\id JHN SAMPLE - World English Bible (public domain), test fixture
\h John
\c 3
\p
\v 16 \wj For God so loved the world, that he gave his only born\wj*\f + \fr 3:16 \ft The phrase “only born” is from the Greek word “μονογενῆ”.\f* \wj Son, that whoever believes in him should not perish, but have eternal life.\wj*
\v 17 \wj For God didn’t send his Son into the world to judge the world, but that the world should be saved through him.\wj*
